      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's not even a \"space for myself.\" it's just emptiness. i look in the mirror and it's like i'm looking through someone. i'm just waiting for reality to catch up to how i actually feel, which is that i'm already gone. it would be so much quieter if everything actually matched.",
